  "body": "Supersedes #2038\n\nGitHub closed #2038 when its parent #2027 merged and its base branch was deleted. This PR has the same branch.\n\n## Merge of main\n\n- `git merge origin/main` was clean (no conflicts), at fac6c8e8d.\n- Main added 18 geometry settings and changed the dark default of `font_caption`. The first merge round added the first 18 to the example and to the guide.\n- Main then added five more geometry settings: `window_margin`, `status_h`, `ribbon_tab_pad_x`, `ribbon_tab_gap` and `ribbon_tab_stroke`. The example lacked them, so `example_has_exactly_the_loader_keys` failed.\n- The review fix adds those five settings with their dark defaults to `assets/themes/theme.json.example`. It also adds their rows to the table in `docs/user-guide/themes.md`, with the ranges from `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme/clamp.rs`.\n- Main now builds `camcraft-ui`. The `Waterjet` arm is on main. This PR has no local edit for it.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Add `assets/themes/theme.json.example`. It holds each colour and each geometry setting of the theme format, with its dark default value. This includes the ribbon keys of #2027.\n- Add `docs/user-guide/themes.md`. It names the file, says how to make a theme from it, and has a table of each setting with its meaning and range.\n- Add `crates/ui/tests/theme_example.rs`. `theme_files.rs` is at 400 lines, so the tests have their own file.\n- Add `docs/decisions/2025-theme-example.md`.\n\nThe test reads the key set from `COLOR_NAMES` and `GEOM_NAMES` in the loader. It keeps no second list.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `example_has_exactly_the_loader_keys`: fails for a key in the code and not in the file, and for the reverse.\n- `example_loads_and_holds_the_dark_defaults`: the file loads with no notes and equals `Tokens::DARK`.\n- `example_is_not_listed_as_a_theme`: the discovery walk lists `.json` files only.\n\n## Test results on head 64a11d5f9\n\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --test theme_example -j 6 -- --test-threads=6`: 3 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --test theme_files -j 6 -- --test-threads=6`: 15 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -j 6 -- -D warnings`: exit 0.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No GUI run. The UI look does not change, so there are no screenshots. No snapshot PNG changed.\n- No `cargo xtask gate` run. Only the three commands above ran.\n\nProcess change: no\n\nChangelog: Add `assets/themes/theme.json.example` that lists each theme setting with its default value, and a user guide page on how to make a theme.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #2025\n",
